sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Visitor
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>SearchFilters
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ViewActiveCategoriesBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ViewActiveCategoriesController
  participant Category as «entity»<br/>Category
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: see the active categories
  UI->>B: GET /api/categories (JWT)
  B->>C: list()
  C->>Category: findActive()
  Category->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Category: rows
  Category-->>C: result
  C-->>B: List<CategoryResponse>
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result